    },
    "It is a Nodus Server": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es un Nodus Server"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It is queued on this device and travels when you send the queue. It joins the vault when its owner next opens Nodus desktop and republishes.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Queda en la cola de este dispositivo y viaja cuando envías la cola. Se incorpora al vault cuando quien lo posee abre Nodus de escritorio y vuelve a publicar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It refers to a “%@”, which this space does not publish.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se refiere a un «%@», que este espacio no publica."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It replaces the copy already in the vault rather than adding a second one.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sustituye a la copia que ya está en el vault en lugar de añadir una segunda."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It travels to the server now. It joins the vault when whoever owns it next opens Nodus desktop and republishes.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Viaja al servidor ahora. Se incorpora al vault cuando quien lo posee abra Nodus de escritorio y vuelva a publicar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It will appear as soon as its owner publishes from Nodus desktop.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aparecerá en cuanto quien lo posee publique desde Nodus de escritorio."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It will be stored in the keychain, available only while the device is unlocked and never leaving it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se guardará en el llavero, disponible solo con el dispositivo desbloqueado y sin salir de él."
