            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El informe quedó incompleto"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The row page keeps blocks, comments, backlinks and ACLs under stable ID %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La página de filas mantiene bloques, comentarios, enlaces inversos y ACLs bajo un ID estable %@."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The row page keeps blocks, comments, backlinks and ACLs under stable ID %@."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The secret could not be encoded.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No se pudo codificar el secreto."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The sections already written are kept, and you can carry on from there later. Nothing more will be spent.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Las secciones ya escritas se conservan y podrás continuar desde ahí más adelante. No se gastará nada más."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server hands over the material and the budget; you choose the model. Your key is kept in this device's keychain and never passes through the Nodus Server.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El servidor entrega el material y el presupuesto; el modelo lo eliges tú. Tu clave se guarda en el llavero de este dispositivo y nunca pasa por el Nodus Server."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server keeps your changes in a ledger. They join the vault when its owner opens Nodus desktop and republishes. Until then nobody sees them, you included.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El servidor guarda tus cambios en un libro mayor. Se incorporan al vault cuando quien lo posee abre Nodus de escritorio y vuelve a publicar. Hasta entonces no los ve nadie, tú incluido."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server no longer accepts this device's credential for “%@”. Adding the server again restores it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El servidor ya no acepta la credencial de este dispositivo para «%@». Volver a añadir el servidor la restablece."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server no longer accepts this device's credential for this space.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El servidor ya no acepta la credencial de este dispositivo para este espacio."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server no longer accepts this device's key for “%@”. Nothing queued is lost; it travels once you have signed in again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El servidor ya no acepta la clave de este dispositivo para «%@». No se pierde nada de lo que esté en la cola: viajará cuando vuelvas a entrar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server refused the request.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
