    "The timetable travels in the publication but has no API route. Download it and it appears instantly.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El horario viaja en la publicación pero no tiene ruta en la API. Descárgala y aparecerá al instante."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The tree needs every relationship at once. The API serves them one at a time, so it is built from the downloaded publication.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El árbol necesita todas las relaciones a la vez. La API las entrega de una en una, así que se arma desde la publicación descargada."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The two releases agree": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
