            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The typed action is sent once and Desktop applies it to the canonical vault."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The vault fixes the model, not this app: retrieval only works when provider, model and dimension all match exactly.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El modelo lo fija el vault, no esta app: la recuperación solo funciona si el proveedor, el modelo y la dimensión coinciden exactamente."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The whole report is in front of the model, numbered. When an answer rests on a passage it says which one, and tapping the number takes you there. Corpus citations work as they do everywhere else.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
